{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Contained? Transmuted? Enchanted. Yes. But memories consumed are not easily won back.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:27:04.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738281493578776599","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"Vee falters. \"To be clear, I... Web and I aren't here for the same thing. I am fine with the loss. It's nothing new to me. It's why I volunteered. But the others, their sacrifice affects a lot of the others we're travelling with.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:27:16.502000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T06:27:58.233000Z","id":"738281543180615680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"I'd expect no less from you Vee. Your selflessness has been noted. And you advance to the second degree.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:28:36.833000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738281880113381496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Fabertell cast Identify on me earlier, and If you have a way you could do so, I'd appreciate it if you took a look.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:30:12.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738282279402602568","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"It seemed to give them some insight.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:31:00.056000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738282480834183188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"I am the keeper of Identify for the Masons. It is we who fill it with its information. You will find no more skilled eyes than mine.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:31:47.361000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738282679245471784","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"Web nods. \"Take a look.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:32:11.250000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738282779443200021","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:32:18.666000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738282810548420619","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Web you are, your silver threads of memory wiped asunder so often like a spider rebuilding their web.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:33:56.653000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738283221535555624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"All because of the ooze?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:34:43.066000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738283416205787137","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"I've had my memories stolen before?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:35:06.005000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738283512418795560","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Wow, that was not the conclusion I drew.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:36:33.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738283880263712819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"He said 'so often'. I assumed that meant this has happened before,\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:37:05.418000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738284013273350165","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"No, transmuted, enchanted and consumed. There are holes inside you and strong boxes that hide things away. Portions have been siphoned by the tether we spoke of before. And now a fresh wound has been consumed. But you know the consequences of your choice. The amount of pain you might endure, might sour the joy if what can be restored is restored.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:37:08.391000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T06:37:49.702000Z","id":"738284025743147049","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"I...don't understand.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:37:54.667000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738284219838496849","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"I knew about the insect and the ooze. Was there another source?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:38:11.224000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738284289283850332","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Its a mess web. But yes. There are several instances of memory influencing magic. Restorable. But a mess.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:40:50.285000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T06:40:58.848000Z","id":"738284956434038796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Will it affect Web today? Like, will it taint any new memories they might gain?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:41:52.903000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738285219072966687","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Could you restore it the ones from the third source without damaging the insect?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:42:26.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738285359846260806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Would it cause me harm?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:42:30.608000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T06:42:35.062000Z","id":"738285377219198987","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"This is both delicate work and intense to restore just a portion rather than using a spell to restore all but the most recent at once.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:43:49.323000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738285707373576232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"And this is the second time you have come to me for help.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:44:07.427000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738285783307517963","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"If I am to assist you there is a question you must answer.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:44:25.294000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738285858247147590","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"I understand.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:46:38.837000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T06:46:43.903000Z","id":"738286418367086602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Can you live your life by the intentions you set? Can you contain the the venom of the spider?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:47:20.371000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T06:47:26.300000Z","id":"738286592573046794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Web, you have no reason to listen to me here but, if I were you, I would just move on. What you have now isn't perfect, and it isn't good, but it is at least *kind*. You don't know what lies in your past. This... this is easier.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T06:48:40.561000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738286928914284554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
